 samples of [url=http://www.discogs.com/Meters-Hand-Clapping-Song/master/354658]\"Hand Clapping Song\"[/url] written by [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/211663-Leo-Nocentelli]Norcelli[/url], [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/267203-George-Porter-Jr]Porter[/url], [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/98586-Cyril-Neville]Neville[/url] and [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/211665-Joseph-Modeliste]Modeliste[/url] and performed by [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/86616-Meters-The]The Meters[/url], courtesy of [l336675] (BMI) and Rhinelander Music and \"Nautilus\" written and performed by [a=Bob James], courtesy of [url=http://www.discogs.com/label/336672-RemididMusic]Remidid Music[/url] (ASCAP) and [l31669].\nB3 contains samples of [url=http://www.discogs.com/Kool-And-The-Gang-Whos-Gonna-Take-The-Weight/master/224857]\"Who's Gonna Take The Weight\"[/url] written by [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/387580-Robert-Kool-Bell]Bell[/url], [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/108893-Ronald-Bell]Bell[/url], [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/387583-Robert-Spike-Mickens]Mickens[/url], [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/387582-Claydes-Smith]Smith[/url], [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/261265-George-Brown]Brown[/url], [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/391095-Roy-Handy]Handy[/url], [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/387581-Dennis-DT-Thomas]Thomas[/url] and [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/387579-Ricky-West]Westfield[/url] and performed by [a48865], courtesy of Warner Tamerlane Corp. (BMI) and [url=http://www.discogs.com/label/66802-Polygram-Special-Markets]PolyGram Special Markets[/url] and \"Absolutions\" performed by [a=Lee Morgan] courtesy of [l=Capitol Records].\nB4 contains a sample of \"Feel Like Makin' Love\" written by [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/202252-Eugene-McDaniels]E. McDaniels[/url] and performed by [a=Roy Ayers], courtesy of [l328062] (BMI) and [url=http://www.discogs.com/label/66802-Polygram-Special-Markets]PolyGram Special Markets[/url].\nB5 contains